/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Rajasthani business ethics reflect the cultural values of honesty, trustworthiness, and community welfare. Rooted in the region's tradition, these ethics prioritize fair dealings, respect for all stakeholders, and social responsibility. Businesses operate with a sense of familial loyalty and dedication to customer satisfaction, often going beyond purely transactional relationships to build lasting bonds within the community. These principles are a cornerstone of the Rajasthani approach to commerce and are integral to maintaining the social fabric of their society.)
