/ActualText (WE ARE REGISTERED TAX AGENTS, ACCOUNTANTS AND BUSINESS ADVISORS WHICH IS MANAGED BY QUALIFIED PROFESSIONALS WITH VAST EXPERIENCE IN TAXATION, ACCOUNTING AND CONSULTANCY. WE HAVE AN OUTSTANDING REPUTATION FOR PROVIDING VALUE ADDED SERVICES TO A LARGE NUMBER OF CLIENTS RANGING FROM INDIVIDUALS TO SMES, TRUSTS, TRUSTEE COMPANIES, COMPANIES, PARTNERSHIPS AND SUPERANNUATION FUNDS, BOTH DOMESTIC AND INTERNATIONAL FOR VARIOUS COMPLIANCES AND NEEDS FOR ACCOUNTING, AUDITING, GST, FBT, FEDERAL AND STATE TAXATION, COMPANY FORMATION AND MANAGEMENT AND SECRETARIAL PRACTICES. WE STRIVE FOR A DEEPER UNDERSTANDING OF OUR CLIENT'S BUSINESS TO MAXIMISE THEIR BENEFIT AND WEALTH IN THE LONG RUN. WE AIM TO FORGE A LONG-TERM RELATIONSHIP WITH ALL OUR CLIENTS. )
