950 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (ALPA IS PASSIONATE ABOUT EXERCISE AND DERIVES GREAT PERSONAL AND PROFESSIONAL SATISFACTION FROM HELPING HER CLIENTS IMPROVE THEIR HEALTH AND WELL-BEING. ALPA IS DRIVEN BY A DESIRE TO ASSIST PEOPLE IN ACHIEVING THEIR GOALS BY PROVIDING EVIDENCE BASED TRAINING AND NUTRITION SOLUTIONS TO FIT AN INDIVIDUALS SITUATION. ALPA USES SCIENCE BASED RESISTANCE COACHING TO ACHIEVE CLIENTS RESULTS. ALPA IS VERY CONCERNED ABOUT HER CLIENTS, AND NOTHING IS MORE IMPORTANT TO HER THAN ASSISTING THEM AND BUILDING THEIR STRENGTH AND CONFIDENCE. SHE UNDERSTANDS HOW BEING OVERWEIGHT AFFECTS MANY FACETS OF ONE'S LIFE, AND SHE WANTS TO ASSIST HER CUSTOMERS DISCOVER THE BENEFITS AND ENJOYMENT OF EXERCISING AND GOOD EATING, WHICH HELPED HER BECOME THE PERSON SHE IS TODAY.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [18]
